<title>USA: Handleman stake cut by investor Harrosh.</title>
<headline>Handleman stake cut by investor Harrosh.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>California investor Joseph Harrosh on Thursday said he reduced his stake in Handleman Co to 4,858,900 common shares, or 14.5 percent of the total.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Harrosh said he sold 355,700 shares between March 12 and April 1 at an average price of $8.33 each.</p>
<p>Shares in the company, which merchandises home entertainment products, were trading at 6-3/4, down 1/8, on Thursday afternoon.</p>
</text>
